SUMMARY:Yahrtzeit: Barbara Atlas (ברכה בת אברהם) — 6th
DESCRIPTION:Observed by the Meer\, Rosen\, and Storz families\, on 2 Tamuz.
  A cherished icon of the Jewish community in Birmingham\, Alabama\, and a 
 teacher who educated three generations of children over her 50-year career
 .\n\nSource text: "By the Meer\, Rosen\, and Storz families in memory of o
 ur beloved aunt\, ברכה בת אברהם\, ז''ל\, Barbara Atlas\, on t
 he occasion of her 6th yahrtzeit on 2 Tamuz. Barbara was a cherished icon 
 of the Jewish community in Birmingham\, Alabama. She was an exceptional te
 acher who was responsible for educating 3 generations of children over her
  50-year career. She instructed them in Hebrew and limudei kodesh and prep
 ared them for their bar/bat mitzvot. Barbara is deeply missed by her famil
 y and her community. May her memory be for a blessing."
CATEGORIES:yahrzeit
END:VEVENT
